 "text": "Hello, how are things going? The earlier the better, really. August in Italy can still be quite hot. That's the spirit. Maybe mention it in an email, so it's not surprise. Yes, he's the one who loves locks the most. Ideally a few days before, so we can give your things a tidy new room. Thirty is fine. The key is quiet and early. Perfect. Give me a shout when you land, and I'll have key waiting. Then take the car and drive somewhere nice for the weekend, instead. The Apennines are lovely in September.",
